## مثال 3: طلبات بـ curl

```bash
URL=https://opposing-cadmium-subsiding.ngrok-free.dev
KEY="WbvhUs0_OZC7fWx29lFYvEGSz2reVwd_vACxD2JtGZc"

curl "$URL/health"

